2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1145) 'Loop 3 runs, and everything it touches stays evaluation only.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1145) 'Why is loop 3 a separate loop rather than a variant? Where its input comes from, and that is a licensing question before it is a technical one.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1145) 'Before any loop 3 output leaves evaluation, confirm it feeds no training run. Read RFD66606-1143 for the keypoints-to-ANNY loop it follows.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1145) 'Run it, and treat everything it touches as evaluation only.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1145) '**The hazard is the holdout.** The COCO-OOD stylized sets are `val2017` restyled, so they are held out twice over: derived from the blinded holdout, and generated. CLAUDE.md states the rule this loop is most likely to break: anything derived from `val2017` inherits its status, and a set generated from a held-out photo carries that photo's content wherever it goes.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1145) 'So loop 3 produces no training data, whatever it produces. A stylized corpus that reaches a training run has taken the holdout with it, and nothing downstream would report that it had.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1145) 'RFD66606-1143, RFD66606-1144 and RFD66606-1146 are the other three loops. RFD66606-1122 is the goal that the four serve.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1145) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1145) 'Loop 3 is loop 2 with a style transfer in front of it: CycleGAN proposes a restyled image, OmniGen2 edits it, EditScore scores the result and OmniGen2 repairs. The artifact is an edited png at the size M, the same as loop 2.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1145  1 LINE
 Text:Written
